#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:2
msgid "AlexNet：真正的未登峰，首登！"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"2012 年，Alex Krizhevsky、Ilya Sutskever 和 Geoffrey Hinton 提交了一个叫 AlexNet "
"的模型 {cite}`krizhevsky2012imagenet`。它的架构并不神秘——本质上就是一个**放大的 LeNet**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:6
msgid ""
"INPUT → CONV → POOL → CONV → POOL → CONV → CONV → CONV → POOL → FC → FC →"
" FC → OUTPUT\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:10
msgid ""
"和 LeNet 的区别是什么呢？更深（8 层 vs 5 层）、更宽（最多 384 个通道 vs 16）、更大（60M 参数 vs "
"61K）。但真正让所有人震惊的不是架构本身，而是**它把错误率从 28.2% 砸到了 15.3%——几乎砍半。**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:12
msgid "那一刻，整个计算机视觉领域听到了炮声。深度学习不是玩具。它能爬真山。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:14
msgid "为什么叫\"炮火\"？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:17
msgid ""
"2012 年之前，ImageNet 竞赛的进步是每年 1-2% 的缓慢爬升，主要由传统 CV 方法的渐进改进驱动。AlexNet "
"一举将错误率降低了 **13 个百分点**——相当于过去十年的进步总和被一个模型超越了。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:19
msgid "这不是改进，是**革命**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:22
msgid "首登的秘密：不只是更大的 LeNet"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:24
msgid "把 LeNet 放大就能赢？没那么简单。AlexNet 之所以能首登，靠的是四个关键设计——每一个都在回答\"更大的山上会遇到什么新问题\"："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:14
msgid "设计"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:14
msgid "解决的问题"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:14
msgid "就像登山"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:14
msgid "**ReLU 激活**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:14
msgid "Sigmoid/Tanh 在深层网络中梯度消失严重"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:14
msgid "高海拔需要高效呼吸——ReLU 不\"憋气\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:14
msgid "**Dropout**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:14
msgid "60M 参数在 140 万张图上极易过拟合"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:14
msgid "每次攀登随机\"关掉\"一部分神经元——逼它们学会独立"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:14
msgid "**GPU 并行**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:14
msgid "一张 GPU 装不下 60M 参数的训练"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:14
msgid "两个人抬装备——模型切成两半，两张 GPU 各算各的"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:14
msgid "**数据增强**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:14
msgid "140 万张图不够 60M 参数学"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:14
msgid "同一块岩壁从不同角度看——随机裁剪、翻转、颜色抖动"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:34
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**LeNet 用的是 Tanh，AlexNet 用的是 ReLU。** 这不是随意的替换。{ref}`activation-functions`"
" 中我们讨论过：Tanh 的饱和区让梯度趋近于零，网络越深问题越严重。ImageNet 需要 8 层——Tanh 根本喘不过气。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:36
msgid "ReLU 简单粗暴：$f(x) = \\max(0, x)$。正区间梯度恒为 1，不会衰减。就像登山者在高海拔换上更高效的呼吸方式。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:39
msgid "架构详解"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:41
msgid "金字塔视角：数据流的维度变化"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:44
msgid "AlexNet 金字塔架构：从图像到1,000类"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:109
msgid "**金字塔的核心洞察**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:111
msgid "**空间维度递减**：224×224 → 6×6（缩小约1,400倍——比LeNet的64倍剧烈得多）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:112
msgid "**特征通道递增**：3 → 96 → 256 → 384 → 256（语义丰富度先升后调）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:113
msgid "**参数量分布**：卷积层约3.7M（占6%），全连接层约57M（占94%）——与LeNet的97%全连接占比一脉相承"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:114
msgid "**比LeNet更深更宽**：8层 vs 5层，最多384通道 vs 16通道，对应更大的山需要更大的容量"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:116
msgid "和 LeNet 的对比"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:130
msgid "ReLU：高海拔的呼吸方式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:132
msgid "AlexNet 是第一个大规模使用 ReLU 的深度网络。为什么这很重要？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:134
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`../practice-peak/cnn-basics` 中的 LeNet 用的是 Tanh。Tanh "
"的问题是：输入稍微大一点，输出就饱和在 ±1，梯度趋近于零。8 层 Tanh，梯度连乘 8 次——前面的层几乎收不到信号。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:136
msgid "ReLU 换了一种呼吸方式："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:138
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\text{ReLU}(x) = \\max(0, x)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:142
msgid ""
"**ReLU 的直觉**：在正区间，梯度永远是 1——不会衰减。在负区间，梯度是 "
"0——神经元\"关掉\"。这种\"要么全开要么全关\"的方式，在深层网络中意外地高效。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:144
msgid "首登之后：暴露的新问题"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:146
msgid "AlexNet 证明了 ImageNet 可以爬。但成功的攀登者会立刻看到新的障碍："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:148
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**11×11 的卷积核太大**——一次看太多，浪费参数且容易过拟合（{doc}`inception` 和 VGG 会回答：用更小的核堆叠）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:149
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**只有一条前向路径**——如果某一层\"学废了\"，整条路就断了（{doc}`res-net` 会回答：加跳跃连接）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:150
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**对所有特征一视同仁**——无论这个通道是\"狗耳朵\"还是\"背景噪声\"，权重一样（{doc}`se-net` 会回答：动态加权）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:152
msgid "**首登永远不是终点。它只是告诉你：这座山更高，新问题更多。**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:156
msgid "代码实践"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:158
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"import torch\n"
"import torch.nn as nn\n"
"\n"
"class AlexNet(nn.Module):\n"
"    \"\"\"AlexNet 的 PyTorch 实现\n"
"    \n"
"    架构：5层卷积 + 3层全连接\n"
"    关键设计：ReLU（高海拔呼吸）、Dropout（防止过拟合）\n"
"    \n"
"    参数量：约 60M（LeNet 的 1,000 倍）\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"
"    def __init__(self, num_classes=1000):\n"
"        super(AlexNet, self).__init__()\n"
"        \n"
"        # 特征提取部分（5层卷积）\n"
"        self.features = nn.Sequential(\n"
"            # CONV1: 11×11 大核——ImageNet 需要更大的初始感受野\n"
"            # 输出: (96, 55, 55)\n"
"            nn.Conv2d(3, 96, kernel_size=11, stride=4, padding=2),\n"
"            nn.ReLU(inplace=True),  # {ref}`activation-"
"functions`——高海拔呼吸方式\n"
"            nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=3, stride=2),  # 降采样\n"
"            \n"
"            # CONV2: 5×5 核——缩小感受野，提取更精细特征\n"
"            # 输出: (256, 27, 27)\n"
"            nn.Conv2d(96, 256, kernel_size=5, padding=2),\n"
"            nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n"
"            nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=3, stride=2),\n"
"            \n"
"            # CONV3-CONV5: 连续3×3卷积——小核堆叠 = 感受野扩大 + 参数更少\n"
"            nn.Conv2d(256, 384, kernel_size=3, padding=1),\n"
"            nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n"
"            \n"
"            nn.Conv2d(384, 384, kernel_size=3, padding=1),\n"
"            nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n"
"            \n"
"            nn.Conv2d(384, 256, kernel_size=3, padding=1),\n"
"            nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n"
"            nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=3, stride=2),\n"
"        )\n"
"        \n"
"        # 分类器部分（3层全连接）\n"
"        self.classifier = nn.Sequential(\n"
"            nn.Dropout(p=0.5),  # 每次随机\"关掉\"一半神经元——逼它们独立学习\n"
"            nn.Linear(256 * 6 * 6, 4096),  # 6×6 来自输入 224×224 经过5层卷积+3次池化"
"\n"
"            nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n"
"            \n"
"            nn.Dropout(p=0.5),\n"
"            nn.Linear(4096, 4096),\n"
"            nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n"
"            \n"
"            nn.Linear(4096, num_classes),  # ImageNet: 1,000 类\n"
"        )\n"
"    \n"
"    def forward(self, x):\n"
"        \"\"\"\n"
"        Args:\n"
"            x: 输入图像 (batch_size, 3, 224, 224)\n"
"        Returns:\n"
"            logits: (batch_size, num_classes)\n"
"        \"\"\"\n"
"        x = self.features(x)       # 卷积特征提取\n"
"        x = torch.flatten(x, 1)    # 展平 → 全连接层输入\n"
"        x = self.classifier(x)     # 分类\n"
"        return x\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/alexnet.md:225
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"# 参数量计算\n"
"model = AlexNet(num_classes=1000)\n"
"total_params = sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters())\n"
"print(f\"AlexNet 总参数量: {total_params:,}\")  # 约 60,965,000\n"
"print(f\"LeNet-5 总参数量: 61,706\")\n"
"print(f\"倍数: {total_params / 61706:.0f}×\")  # 约 988×\n"
msgstr ""

